OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FITV News Sports Editor Steve Scott
OL,8,Fexplains how bad the punishment could
OL,9,Fget for Manchester City, and the
OL,10,Framifications for the Premier League
OL,12,FBy ITV News Producer Andy Ward
OL,14,FThe smile on Enzo Maresca's face said
OL,15,Fit all.
OL,17,F"Thank you! Finally," he joked.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
