OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FThe Manchester City manager had just
OL,8,Fbeen asked by a Norwegian journalist
OL,9,Fhow star striker Erling Haaland was
OL,10,Ffeeling after a bruising four-game
OL,11,Fschedule for his country over the
OL,12,Finternational break.
OL,14,FThe question was a moment of light
OL,15,Frelief in a football press conference
OL,16,Fthat wasn't really anything to do with
OL,17,Ffootball.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FThis was the first time a senior
OL,8,Ffigure at City had spoken to the media
OL,9,Fsince the club were found guilty of
OL,10,Fthe majority of the 115 charges
OL,11,Fbrought against them by the Premier
OL,12,FLeague.
OL,14,FWatch in full: Manchester City's first
OL,15,Fpress conference since Premier League
OL,16,Frule breaches
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FThe fact that Maresca arrived four
OL,8,Fminutes early was all the proof needed
OL,9,Fthat everyone connected with the club
OL,10,Fwas keen to get this over and done
OL,11,Fwith as soon as possible.
OL,13,FIt didn't take long for the cross-
OL,14,Fexamination to start.
OL,16,FWhen asked whether he understood why
OL,17,Fthere is "so much outrage and anger",
OL,18,FMaresca was calm and collected in his
OL,19,Fresponse.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,F"There is a process ongoing, and in
OL,8,Fthis moment, I completely trust the
OL,9,Fclub."
OL,11,FIt was a theme that would dominate the
OL,12,Fexchanges. As far as Maresca was
OL,13,Fconcerned, he'd been given no reason
OL,14,Fto doubt that City would clear their
OL,15,Fname.
OL,17,F"I will speak more about this when we
OL,18,Fwin this appeal," he promised.
OL,20,FNot if, but when.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FThe belief that City will ultimately
OL,8,Femerge victorious stems from what they
OL,9,Fhave described as "a comprehensive
OL,10,Fbody of irrefutable evidence" that
OL,11,Fwill prove the independent
OL,12,Fcommission's findings to be untrue.
OL,14,FIt is believed to centre around the
OL,15,Ffact that the infamous "sham"
OL,16,Fsponsorship deals were funded by the
OL,17,FAbu Dhabi government, rather than the
OL,18,Fclub's owners.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
