PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FMaresca may only have been appointed
OL,8,Fas manager in the summer, but his
OL,9,Fassociation with City goes back to
OL,10,F2023 when he worked under Pep
OL,11,FGuardiola as his assistant.
OL,13,FIt was during this period that the
OL,14,FPremier League first charged City with
OL,15,F115 breaches of its financial
OL,16,Fregulations.
OL,18,FDid he feel that the club's titles had
OL,19,Fbeen tainted by recent developments?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,303,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,F"Absolutely not," came the robust
OL,8,Fresponse to ITV News' Steve Scott's
OL,9,Fquestion.
OL,11,FYou'd be forgiven for forgetting that
OL,12,FManchester City return to Premier
OL,13,FLeague action this weekend at Anfield
OL,14,Fof all places - a hostile venue at the
OL,15,Fbest of times, but even more so this
OL,16,FSunday.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
