SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FThose on the red half of Merseyside
OL,8,Fargue that they'd have another three
OL,9,Ftitles to their name had Manchester
OL,10,FCity not made a calculated attempted
OL,11,Fto "circumvent the rules" as the
OL,12,FPremier League put it.
OL,14,FOf course, that period of history has
OL,15,Flittle to do with the current crop of
OL,16,FCity stars, but it will be them who
OL,17,Fare left to face the music this
OL,18,Fweekend.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
