PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,F"For me and for the players, we can
OL,8,Fonly control the football side. We are
OL,9,Fonly focused on that," said Maresca,
OL,10,Fwho was relaxed throughout.
OL,12,FIt's the only choice they've got.
OL,14,FUntil the appeal process is concluded,
OL,15,Fboth City and the rest of the Premier
OL,16,FLeague clubs find themselves in a
OL,17,Fstrange state of limbo - not knowing
OL,18,Fwhat the rest of this season, and the
OL,19,Fseasons to come, could bring.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
