OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1791571696
OL,3,CMaresca unfazed as boss faces media
OL,4,Cfor first time since Man City guilty
OL,5,Cverdict
OL,7,FWhat is for sure is that supporters of
OL,8,Frival fans won't let them forget the
OL,9,Fmagnitude of the situation they're
OL,10,Ffacing.
OL,12,FA red-hot reception at Anfield on
OL,13,FSunday promises to just be the start.
